1
00:00:04,393 --> 00:00:06,920
The Lives Of The Prophets Part 2

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,036
اَلْحَمْدُ لله ، وَالصَّلَاةُ وَالسَّلَامُ عَلى سَيِّدِنَا محمد وَعَلَى اَلِهِ وَصَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ

3
00:00:12,763 --> 00:00:17,001
Now, things were getting a little bit difficult on Firaun(فرعون).

4
00:00:17,541 --> 00:00:21,121
Because this embarrassing event happened in front of all of the people of Egypt.

5
00:00:21,701 --> 00:00:25,114
So, the evil advisors of Firaun(فرعون) came to him and said;

6
00:00:25,407 --> 00:00:29,154
You need to do something; You can't let things get out of control.

7
00:00:29,326 --> 00:00:35,535
And these are the parasites living under Firaun(فرعون) who are benefiting from the situation; benefiting from the status quo.

8
00:00:35,742 --> 00:00:38,655
Because these oppressive leaders, they don't exist in a vacuum.

9
00:00:39,302 --> 00:00:44,003
Az-Zalamah(اظلمه); the oppressors; these kings; they don't live in a vacuum;

10
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:47,563
They have an underlying power under them.

11
00:00:47,876 --> 00:00:51,221
They have Chiefs; Al-Mala(اَلمَلاَ); They have advisors; They have a government;

12
00:00:51,489 --> 00:00:55,060
They have people who are serving them and helping them; Otherwise, they can't exist alone.

13
00:00:56,027 --> 00:00:59,853
And Firaun(فرعون); even though he claimed to be God and he claimed to be the owner of Egypt.

14
00:00:59,947 --> 00:01:00,995
 لِمُلْكُ مِصَر

15
00:01:01,213 --> 00:01:04,035
Nevertheless, he still had to depend on these people under him.

16
00:01:04,161 --> 00:01:11,495
And these are parasites who are benefiting financially and benefiting from the positions, they are getting under the leadership of Firaun(فرعون).

17
00:01:12,025 --> 00:01:13,911
So, they are looking for their benefit also.

18
00:01:14,078 --> 00:01:24,395
وَقَالَ ٱلْمَلَأُ مِن قَوْمِ فِرْعَوْنَ أَتَذَرُ مُوسَىٰ وَقَوْمَهُۥ لِيُفْسِدُواْ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَيَذَرَكَ وَءَالِهَتَكَ ۚ

19
00:01:24,801 --> 00:01:28,605
The chiefs of Firaun's people said;

20
00:01:28,825 --> 00:01:32,492
Will you leave Musa(موسى) and his people to spread mischief in the land?

21
00:01:32,692 --> 00:01:37,368
And to abandon you and your gods or going to let this happen or going to let this go?

22
00:01:38,028 --> 00:01:39,528
So, they pushed Firaun(فرعون); So he said;

23
00:01:39,609 --> 00:01:50,938
قَالَ سَنُقَتِّلُ أَبْنَآءَهُمْ وَنَسْتَحْىِۦ نِسَآءَهُمْ وَإِنَّا فَوْقَهُمْ قَٰهِرُونَ۝

24
00:01:51,128 --> 00:01:57,798
He said; We will kill their sons and we will let their women live and we have irresistible power over them.

25
00:01:58,324 --> 00:02:00,376
Didn't Firaun(فرعون) issue this order before?

26
00:02:01,729 --> 00:02:02,883
When did he issue it?

27
00:02:03,349 --> 00:02:04,576
When Musa(موسى) was born.

28
00:02:06,143 --> 00:02:10,435
Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); When this issue was decreed; Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); What did they say?

29
00:02:10,708 --> 00:02:12,722
أُوذِينَا مِنْ قَبْلِ أَنْ تَأْتِيَنَا

30
00:02:13,475 --> 00:02:20,000
Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); they said; We have received harm when you were born and we're receiving harm from you now.

31
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:22,607
All this trouble is because of you.

32
00:02:22,913 --> 00:02:26,820
They were killing us in the beginning because of you, because of your birth.

33
00:02:27,267 --> 00:02:29,013
That is why our children were killed.

34
00:02:29,326 --> 00:02:32,179
And now our children are killed again; Why?

35
00:02:32,346 --> 00:02:33,846
Because of you another time.

36
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:39,410
And this is the nature of the people who are not willing to sacrifice anything for the sake of Allah.

37
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:41,410
People are already humiliated; They're crushed.

38
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:45,053
And they don't want to move ahead; And they're not willing to give anything.

39
00:02:45,133 --> 00:02:46,153
They want victory;

40
00:02:46,566 --> 00:02:48,160
They want success;

41
00:02:48,306 --> 00:02:49,373
They want position;

42
00:02:49,533 --> 00:02:52,053
But they're not willing to pay the price for it.

43
00:02:52,772 --> 00:02:57,164
And unfortunately, sometimes; we're guilty of doing the same thing.

44
00:02:58,211 --> 00:03:00,582
How come Islam is not established?

45
00:03:00,668 --> 00:03:02,982
How come there is no Khilafah(خِلَافَه)? How come?

46
00:03:03,474 --> 00:03:07,352
And this person, you find him; he's not doing anything and he's blaming the whole Ummah(امة).

47
00:03:07,685 --> 00:03:09,152
And he's the only one who's innocent.

48
00:03:09,559 --> 00:03:12,965
Look at the Muslims! Look at the Muslims! And he's speaking about everyone; but himself.

49
00:03:13,559 --> 00:03:14,921
Why is the problem in Chechnya happening?

50
00:03:14,951 --> 00:03:16,701
Why is the problem in Iraq(عراق) happening?

51
00:03:16,731 --> 00:03:18,335
Why is the problem in Falastine(فلسطين) happening?

52
00:03:18,475 --> 00:03:19,821
Why is it happening in Kashmir(كشمير)?

53
00:03:20,008 --> 00:03:21,933
It is because of the faults of me and you.

54
00:03:22,248 --> 00:03:25,256
Don't think that the problem of Kashmir(كشمير) is a Kashmiri(كشميرى) problem,

55
00:03:25,536 --> 00:03:28,062
or the problem of the Chechens is a Chechnyan's problem,

56
00:03:28,236 --> 00:03:30,609
or the problem of Falastine(فلسطين) is a Falastini(فلسطينى) problem.

57
00:03:30,782 --> 00:03:32,515
This is a problem of the Muslim Ummah(امة).

58
00:03:32,629 --> 00:03:35,969
Because Allahسُبحانه وتعالى does not know these different states and nations.

59
00:03:36,428 --> 00:03:39,802
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى knows one Ummah(امة); one Ummah(امة).

60
00:03:39,896 --> 00:03:44,509
So, whenever there's a punishment or there's a problem or there's a suffering in one part of the Ummah(امة).

61
00:03:44,696 --> 00:03:46,126
It is the suffering for all of us.

62
00:03:46,286 --> 00:03:48,586
And we are all held responsible for it.

63
00:03:49,033 --> 00:03:54,168
So the problems we are going through now are because of us; And we are responsible for solving them.

64
00:03:54,375 --> 00:04:02,351
قَالُوا أُوذِينَا مِن قَبْلِ أَن تَأْتِيَنَا وَمِن بَعْدِ مَا جِئْتَنَا ۚ

65
00:04:02,570 --> 00:04:08,023
They said; We had suffered troubles before you came to us and since you've came to us.

66
00:04:08,563 --> 00:04:09,909
But Musa(موسى) told them;

67
00:04:10,129 --> 00:04:20,551
قَالَ عَسَىٰ رَبُّكُمْ أَن يُهْلِكَ عَدُوَّكُمْ وَيَسْتَخْلِفَكُمْ فِي الْأَرْضِ فَيَنظُرَ كَيْفَ تَعْمَلُونَ۝

68
00:04:20,792 --> 00:04:26,631
It may be that Your Lord will destroy your enemy and make you successors on Earth so that He may see how you act.

69
00:04:26,845 --> 00:04:28,798
Allah will give you a victory over your enemy.

70
00:04:28,925 --> 00:04:32,491
And Allah will give you Khilafah(خِلَافَه). But you have to go through the sacrifice.

71
00:04:32,858 --> 00:04:35,911
That's the natural path to achieve victory.

72
00:04:36,125 --> 00:04:38,331
And then Musa(موسى) told his people in the Ayah(آية) before;

73
00:04:38,571 --> 00:04:55,118
قَالَ مُوسَىٰ لِقَوْمِهِ اسْتَعِينُوا بِاللَّهِ وَاصْبِرُوا ۖ إِنَّ الْأَرْضَ لِلَّهِ يُورِثُهَا مَن يَشَاءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهِ ۖ وَالْعَاقِبَةُ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ۝

74
00:04:55,416 --> 00:04:57,488
He said; Seek help from Allah and be patient.

75
00:04:57,710 --> 00:05:01,150
We have to be patient; Verily, the Earth is Allah's;

76
00:05:01,343 --> 00:05:07,234
He gives it as a heritage to whom He wills of His slave and blessed in the end for Al-Muttaqin(المتقين).

77
00:05:08,154 --> 00:05:12,448
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent to Musa(موسى) Ayaat(آيات); signs.

78
00:05:12,754 --> 00:05:15,689
How many signs do we already know of up till this moment?

79
00:05:16,549 --> 00:05:16,802
Two;

80
00:05:16,862 --> 00:05:20,289
Which are the stick and the hand.

81
00:05:20,556 --> 00:05:22,743
The Ayaat(آيات) in total were nine.

82
00:05:23,177 --> 00:05:24,683
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

83
00:05:24,963 --> 00:05:36,240
وَلَقَدْ أَخَذْنَا آلَ فِرْعَوْنَ بِالسِّنِينَ وَنَقْصٍ مِّنَ الثَّمَرَاتِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَذَّكَّرُونَ۝

84
00:05:36,452 --> 00:05:42,836
And indeed We punish the people of Pharoah with years of drought and shortness of fruits that they may remember.

85
00:05:43,116 --> 00:05:50,311
So these are another two, which are; the drought and they don't have any fruits.

86
00:05:50,518 --> 00:05:55,088
So now, we have four and then we have another five mentioned in another Ayah(آية).

87
00:05:55,368 --> 00:05:58,666
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is sending them Ayaat(آيات) and Allah says;

88
00:05:58,696 --> 00:06:02,769
Whenever We send them a sign, We send them a following sign which is greater than the one before it.

89
00:06:03,059 --> 00:06:05,052
So, Allah is sending them powerful signs.

90
00:06:05,082 --> 00:06:06,453
Why? For them to remember.

91
00:06:07,019 --> 00:06:10,536
The stick was not enough; The hand was not enough.

92
00:06:10,838 --> 00:06:12,532
So Allah sent on them drought.

93
00:06:13,008 --> 00:06:14,741
Drought; they would get no rain.

94
00:06:15,174 --> 00:06:15,674
And;

95
00:06:15,704 --> 00:06:17,781
نَقْصٍ مِّنَ الثَّمَرَاتِ

96
00:06:18,048 --> 00:06:19,946
They would have less fruits.

97
00:06:20,219 --> 00:06:22,871
Al-Hassan(الحسن) says; these two signs are one.

98
00:06:23,764 --> 00:06:29,877
And he would replace another one with Al-bahr(البحر); he would count the splitting of the sea as one sign.

99
00:06:30,117 --> 00:06:31,842
So then we have five left.

100
00:06:32,022 --> 00:06:39,653
Okay now, when these two signs occurred; Firaun(فرعون) and his people came to Musa(موسى) and they told him;

101
00:06:39,683 --> 00:06:43,853
Can you please ask your Lord to release us from this drought and from this problem?

102
00:06:44,447 --> 00:06:50,493
So they sent him a delegation from the government to meet with Musa(موسى) and tell him; Please! Release us from this problem.

103
00:06:51,230 --> 00:06:53,301
Musa(موسى) made Dua(دُعَا) to Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

104
00:06:53,361 --> 00:06:56,214
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى provided them with rain and fruits again.

105
00:06:56,407 --> 00:06:57,434
فَاِذَا هُمْ يَنكُثُونَ۝

106
00:06:57,587 --> 00:06:59,278
They broke their promise to Musa(موسى).

107
00:06:59,684 --> 00:07:01,064
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

108
00:07:01,524 --> 00:07:03,258
فَأَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمُ الطُّوفَانَ

109
00:07:03,477 --> 00:07:06,211
The next sign was the flood.

110
00:07:07,443 --> 00:07:10,230
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى made the Nile River flood.

111
00:07:10,497 --> 00:07:16,753
So, it would flood on the banks; it would cover their fields and then the water would stick there.

112
00:07:17,239 --> 00:07:18,779
So they cannot plant in the fields.

113
00:07:18,953 --> 00:07:20,513
The water doesn't want go anywhere.

114
00:07:21,299 --> 00:07:23,293
It was an amazing flood; it's a miracle.

115
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:28,173
The Nile River flooded and the water went over the banks.

116
00:07:28,386 --> 00:07:30,726
And then the water stayed right there; it didn't move.

117
00:07:30,756 --> 00:07:33,326
So, all of the fields were covered; So they cannot plant.

118
00:07:33,479 --> 00:07:35,053
So, they want to Musa(موسى) and they said;

119
00:07:35,333 --> 00:07:44,263
وَلَمَّا وَقَعَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلرِّجْزُ قَالُواْ يَٰمُوسَى ٱدْعُ لَنَا رَبَّكَ بِمَا عَهِدَ عِندَكَ ۖ

120
00:07:44,643 --> 00:07:55,707
لَئِن كَشَفْتَ عَنَّا ٱلرِّجْزَ لَنُؤْمِنَنَّ لَكَ وَلَنُرْسِلَنَّ مَعَكَ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ۝

121
00:07:56,022 --> 00:07:58,173
And when the punishment fell on them, they said;

122
00:07:58,203 --> 00:08:02,612
Oh Musa(موسى)! Invoke your Lord for us; because of His promise to you;

123
00:08:02,769 --> 00:08:06,956
If you will remove the punishment for us; we indeed shall believe in you,

124
00:08:07,096 --> 00:08:12,369
we will believe in you and we are going to let the children of Israel(اسرائيل) go with you.

125
00:08:13,022 --> 00:08:18,869
Musa(موسى) wanted two things; he wanted them to believe and he wanted Firaun(فرعون) to release Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) from the slavery.

126
00:08:19,824 --> 00:08:24,117
Firaun(فرعون) said; I'll give you the two things you want from me;

127
00:08:24,147 --> 00:08:28,338
I'm going to believe and I'm going to release the children of Israel(اسرائيل) with you.

128
00:08:28,518 --> 00:08:29,918
Why was Firaun(فرعون) saying that?

129
00:08:30,218 --> 00:08:33,925
Because he needs Musa(موسى) otherwise his kingdom is going to be lost.

130
00:08:34,218 --> 00:08:37,171
They think in their interest; interest rules.

131
00:08:38,278 --> 00:08:40,545
So they went to Musa(موسى) and they said;

132
00:08:40,598 --> 00:08:44,774
Please; ask Allah; Your Lord, to release us from this punishment.

133
00:08:45,167 --> 00:08:48,228
And if you do so we're gonna believe in you and I'm going to send Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

134
00:08:48,534 --> 00:08:51,694
Musa(موسى) made Dua(دُعَا) to Allah so the water receded.

135
00:08:51,854 --> 00:08:54,780
Now they went to their fields and they started planting again.

136
00:08:55,387 --> 00:08:58,913
They said; We don't know who you are, we're not going to believe and we're not going to send Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

137
00:08:59,693 --> 00:09:02,802
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent on them another sign after At-Tufan(اَلطُّوفَانَ);

138
00:09:03,008 --> 00:09:04,328
وَالْجَرَادَ

139
00:09:04,742 --> 00:09:09,227
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent on them locusts; grasshoppers; locusts.

140
00:09:09,554 --> 00:09:14,054
Allah sent on them clouds of locusts that would block the sun.

141
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:19,908
And these clouds would march over their fields and eat anything they find in front of them.

142
00:09:20,034 --> 00:09:24,718
They would eat all of the plants and the trees in the field; they would leave them dead

143
00:09:24,871 --> 00:09:27,511
and then they would march on the houses and eat the wood.

144
00:09:28,711 --> 00:09:36,137
Miracle from Allah; destruction that went over Egypt; clouds of locusts marching over the land of Egypt; destroying everything.

145
00:09:36,350 --> 00:09:39,964
They went to Musa(موسى) begging; Oh Musa(موسى)! asked Allah to release us from this punishment.

146
00:09:40,018 --> 00:09:41,838
We're gonna believe and send Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) with you.

147
00:09:42,404 --> 00:09:45,409
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى released that punishment from them;

148
00:09:45,589 --> 00:09:46,702
فَاِذَا هُمْ يَنكُثُونَ۝

149
00:09:46,849 --> 00:09:48,476
They broke their promise again.

150
00:09:49,835 --> 00:09:51,389
Look at this; Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

151
00:09:51,515 --> 00:09:56,047
وَقَالُوا مَهْمَا تَأْتِنَا بِهِ مِنْ آيَةٍ لِّتَسْحَرَنَا بِهَا فَمَا نَحْنُ لَكَ بِمُؤْمِنِينَ۝

152
00:09:56,355 --> 00:10:03,608
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says; they said whatever Ayah(آيَةٍ) you bring us; to work there with your sorcerer; we shall never believe in you.

153
00:10:03,755 --> 00:10:05,628
وَإِن يَرَوْا كُلَّ آيَةٍ لَّا يُؤْمِنُوا بِهَا

154
00:10:05,688 --> 00:10:08,935
Allah says about these people; If they see every sign, they will not believe.

155
00:10:09,228 --> 00:10:15,289
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent on them another sign which is; Al-Qammal(القمل); Lice or ticks.

156
00:10:15,609 --> 00:10:17,822
Allah sent on them lice and ticks.

157
00:10:18,329 --> 00:10:21,442
These insects that bite your body and they suck the blood.

158
00:10:21,709 --> 00:10:26,242
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent these insects on them in millions.

159
00:10:26,536 --> 00:10:30,963
Their clothes would be filled inside with lice and ticks.

160
00:10:31,237 --> 00:10:34,830
When they would go in their beds; it would be lined up with lice and ticks.

161
00:10:35,083 --> 00:10:41,076
Wherever they go; these ticks are flying around in their houses and over their bodies.

162
00:10:41,289 --> 00:10:43,409
Their life became terrible and miserable.

163
00:10:43,722 --> 00:10:44,748
They couldn't stand it.

164
00:10:44,988 --> 00:10:46,372
And who can release them from that?

165
00:10:46,483 --> 00:10:47,263
Allah.

166
00:10:47,463 --> 00:10:48,543
They went to Musa(موسى).

167
00:10:48,956 --> 00:10:50,236
Musa(موسى) made Dua(دُعَا).

168
00:10:50,596 --> 00:10:52,403
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى took away the punishment.

169
00:10:52,649 --> 00:10:53,689
فَاِذَا هُمْ يَنكُثُونَ۝

170
00:10:53,719 --> 00:10:54,749
They broke their promise again.

171
00:10:55,335 --> 00:10:57,769
Subhaan Allah(سُبْحَان الله)! Look at the insistence on Kuffr(كفر).

172
00:10:58,268 --> 00:11:01,821
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent on them another sign; Frogs.

173
00:11:02,722 --> 00:11:07,753
One of them would put his clothes on; frogs would jump on his body.

174
00:11:08,313 --> 00:11:12,007
He would open up his mouth to eat; a frog would hop in his mouth.

175
00:11:12,994 --> 00:11:15,960
He's eating his food; the frog would land right over it.

176
00:11:16,654 --> 00:11:19,427
He goes to bed; he's crushing frogs under him.

177
00:11:20,214 --> 00:11:27,176
Frogs; wherever they go; It says in the Tafseer(تفسير) that; a group of them would be eating and frogs would jump in their food.

178
00:11:27,883 --> 00:11:31,194
They would open their mouths and their mouths would be filled with frogs.

179
00:11:32,587 --> 00:11:35,927
They went to Musa(موسى); Oh Musa(موسى)! Release us from this punishment; Adhaab(عذاب); Rijs(رجس).

180
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:39,158
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى released them from this;

181
00:11:39,758 --> 00:11:40,778
فَاِذَا هُمْ يَنكُثُونَ۝

182
00:11:40,808 --> 00:11:42,358
They broke their promise another time.

183
00:11:42,951 --> 00:11:46,238
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى then sent on them; Ad-Damm(اَلدَّمَ) Blood.

184
00:11:47,677 --> 00:11:50,845
Allah-u-Aalam(اللَّهُ أَعْلمَ), what the exact punishment, was it blood.?

185
00:11:51,377 --> 00:11:53,280
But some of the Mufassireen(مفسرين) say;

186
00:11:53,835 --> 00:11:59,182
that the people of Firaun(فرعون) would go; the people of Egypt would go and take water from the Nile River;

187
00:11:59,589 --> 00:12:02,146
By the time they reach home; it is thick blood.

188
00:12:02,679 --> 00:12:07,706
They will take water out of their wells by the time they want to drink it; it is thick blood.

189
00:12:08,332 --> 00:12:11,894
Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); who take water from the Nile River and they would drink it; is water.

190
00:12:12,341 --> 00:12:14,981
They would take water from the wells; it would be water.

191
00:12:15,274 --> 00:12:17,957
With the Egyptians and the people Firaun(فرعون); it would turn into blood.

192
00:12:18,484 --> 00:12:19,950
What can they do? They need to drink.

193
00:12:20,904 --> 00:12:23,518
They went to Musa(موسى) and said; release us from this punishment.

194
00:12:23,678 --> 00:12:30,925
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى released them from this punishment but that was the last sign that they would receive.

195
00:12:31,892 --> 00:12:34,172
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى gave them enough chances.

196
00:12:35,285 --> 00:12:43,892
And they committed their Kuffr(كفر) with insistence; and they have seen all of the signs; and they were still on the Kuffr(كفر) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

197
00:12:44,079 --> 00:12:50,698
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says that; Firaun(فرعون) after that; said;

198
00:12:50,798 --> 00:13:01,125
وَنَادَىٰ فِرْعَوْنُ فِي قَوْمِهِ قَالَ يَا قَوْمِ أَلَيْسَ لِي مُلْكُ مِصْرَ وَهَٰذِهِ الْأَنْهَارُ

199
00:13:01,291 --> 00:13:09,128
وَهَٰذِهِ الْأَنْهَارُ تَجْرِي مِن تَحْتِي ۖ أَفَلَا تُبْصِرُونَ۝

200
00:13:09,508 --> 00:13:17,135
أَمْ أَنَا خَيْرٌ مِّنْ هَٰذَا الَّذِي هُوَ مَهِينٌ وَلَا يَكَادُ يُبِينُ۝

201
00:13:17,276 --> 00:13:18,102
Allah says;

202
00:13:18,302 --> 00:13:20,693
And Pharoah proclaimed among his people saying;

203
00:13:21,003 --> 00:13:27,193
Oh my people! Is not mine, the dominion of Egypt and these rivers flowing underneath me; see you not?

204
00:13:28,249 --> 00:13:30,356
Am I not better than this man?

205
00:13:30,809 --> 00:13:33,516
And he can scarcely express himself clearly.

206
00:13:33,903 --> 00:13:40,533
Firaun(فرعون) is saying; Am I not better than this man; who's Maheen(مَهِينٌ); who's degraded; who's weak; He is saying this about Musa(موسى).

207
00:13:40,791 --> 00:13:41,878
وَلَا يَكَادُ يُبِينُ۝

208
00:13:41,938 --> 00:13:43,138
He's not even able to speak.

209
00:13:43,624 --> 00:13:45,638
He's making fun of the speech of Musa(موسى).

210
00:13:45,964 --> 00:13:48,007
Because we said; Musa(موسى) has a problem in speaking.

211
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,652
Firaun(فرعون) was making fun of that.

212
00:13:49,931 --> 00:13:52,551
And then look at the standards of Firaun(فرعون).

213
00:13:52,662 --> 00:13:55,739
Firaun(فرعون) is saying that; he is Maheen(مَهِين); he is degraded; he's low class.

214
00:13:56,245 --> 00:13:56,992
Why?

215
00:13:57,179 --> 00:13:58,379
Firaun(فرعون) says;

216
00:13:58,885 --> 00:14:04,787
Why then are not golden bracelets bestowed on him; or angel sent along with him?

217
00:14:05,114 --> 00:14:07,567
How come Musa(موسى) does not have any gold bracelets?

218
00:14:07,841 --> 00:14:10,741
Look at the standard of thinking of Firaun(فرعون).

219
00:14:11,294 --> 00:14:12,776
How come he doesn't have any gold?

220
00:14:13,242 --> 00:14:14,376
Why is he poor?

221
00:14:14,922 --> 00:14:16,329
Why doesn't he have angels with him?

222
00:14:16,442 --> 00:14:20,585
Why does he need to seek assistance from the weak slaves of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل)?

223
00:14:21,247 --> 00:14:23,261
That is the way they think.

224
00:14:23,441 --> 00:14:24,727
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

225
00:14:24,894 --> 00:14:29,119
فَاسْتَخَفَّ قَوْمَهُ فَأَطَاعُوهُ ۚ

226
00:14:29,332 --> 00:14:34,439
إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا قَوْمًا فَاسِقِينَ۝

227
00:14:34,823 --> 00:14:37,271
Allahu Akbar(الله اكبر); this Ayah(آية); we need to understand it.

228
00:14:37,404 --> 00:14:44,846
Thus he; Firaun(فرعون); be fooled and misled his people and they obeyed him.

229
00:14:45,439 --> 00:14:49,006
Firaun(فرعون) misled his people and they obeyed him.

230
00:14:49,306 --> 00:14:53,168
Firaun(فرعون) treated them with humiliation and they obeyed him.

231
00:14:53,675 --> 00:14:54,261
Why?

232
00:14:54,441 --> 00:14:55,781
إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا قَوْمًا فَاسِقِينَ۝

233
00:14:55,848 --> 00:14:56,961
Because they will corrupt people.

234
00:14:57,241 --> 00:15:01,579
Any people who would fall into the trap of following a man like Firaun(فرعون); are corrupt.

235
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:08,432
Any people who receive the oppression and then they give loyalty to that king or leader are corrupt.

236
00:15:08,659 --> 00:15:12,433
How could you give loyalty to a man like Firaun(فرعون) who was oppressive; Zalim(ظالم)?

237
00:15:12,753 --> 00:15:14,279
That is because of their corruption.

238
00:15:14,346 --> 00:15:20,528
If they were not corrupt; they would not agree to live under the Dominion, under the rule of Firaun(فرعون).

239
00:15:20,802 --> 00:15:22,502
And this Ayah(آية) describes a lot.

240
00:15:22,762 --> 00:15:28,537
When the leaders belittle the people and treat them with humility and the people follow them; That's a sign of their corruption.

241
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:30,203
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

242
00:15:30,290 --> 00:15:44,233
فَمَآ ءَامَنَ لِمُوسَىٰٓ إِلَّا ذُرِّيَّةٌ مِّن قَوْمِهِۦ عَلَىٰ خَوْفٍۢ مِّن فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَإِيْهِمْ أَن يَفْتِنَهُمْ ۚ

243
00:15:44,565 --> 00:15:47,459
But none believed in Musa(موسى) except the offspring of his people;

244
00:15:47,489 --> 00:15:48,595
Zuriyyah(ذرية) means young.

245
00:15:48,758 --> 00:15:50,384
Who are the people who believed in Musa(موسى)?

246
00:15:50,544 --> 00:15:51,303
The young.

247
00:15:51,671 --> 00:15:53,293
There are two Tafseer(تفسير) given of this Ayah(آية)

248
00:15:53,313 --> 00:15:55,584
either it is talking about the young of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل);

249
00:15:55,731 --> 00:15:58,813
meaning that the youth of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) followed Musa(موسى) but the elders didn't.

250
00:15:59,013 --> 00:16:00,473
The other Tafseer(تفسير) is that,

251
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:07,475
all of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) followed Musa(موسى) and some of the youth of the people of Egypt also follow them.

252
00:16:08,402 --> 00:16:13,941
 And these are the ones who follow the Rasool Allah ﷺ, and these are the ones who follow the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء), they are youth.

253
00:16:14,728 --> 00:16:17,201
Because the elders; they're already established.

254
00:16:17,635 --> 00:16:23,420
They have a business; they have a wife; they have children; they have a job.

255
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:26,586
They're not willing to sacrifice any of that and follow a Nabi(نَبِي).

256
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:36,680
So they're willing to live, subdued, as long as they will still have the wealth and the family and the kids.

257
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:42,886
And the ones who are willing to sacrifice and go ahead and give to Allahسُبحانه وتعالى are the youth.

258
00:16:43,554 --> 00:16:47,576
But even though they still had fear; that Firaun(فرعون) would kill them.

259
00:16:47,601 --> 00:16:50,581
This regime was unbelievable.

260
00:16:50,888 --> 00:16:53,940
I mean; people would hear the name of Firaun(فرعون) their knees would shake.

261
00:16:54,294 --> 00:16:55,727
It was a very difficult situation.

262
00:16:55,947 --> 00:16:58,604
وَإِنَّ فِرْعَوْنَ لَعَالٍۢ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَإِنَّهُۥ لَمِنَ ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ۝

263
00:16:58,628 --> 00:17:04,019
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says; Firaun(فرعون) was an arrogant, tyrant on the Earth.

264
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:06,639
And he was indeed one of Al-Musrifeen(الْمُسْرِفِينَ).

265
00:17:06,746 --> 00:17:09,312
Al-Musrifeen(الْمُسْرِفِينَ) are the once who transgressed the bounds.

266
00:17:10,272 --> 00:17:12,418
He was powerful; a powerful tyrant.

267
00:17:12,732 --> 00:17:18,940
So even these youth who followed him; they still had fear from Firaun(فرعون) that he might kill them.

268
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:27,762
Syedina Musaعليه السلامwas beginning to feel that, the end with Firaun(فرعون) is soon.

269
00:17:28,315 --> 00:17:35,512
He has given him all of the signs which he received from Allahسُبحانه وتعالى; nevertheless, Firaun(فرعون) is still insisting on disbelief.

270
00:17:35,752 --> 00:17:38,612
And things were becoming more difficult on Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

271
00:17:38,805 --> 00:17:40,372
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

272
00:17:40,392 --> 00:17:54,464
وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ يَٰقَوْمِ إِن كُنتُمْ ءَامَنتُم بِٱللَّهِ فَعَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلُوٓاْ إِن كُنتُم مُّسْلِمِينَ۝

273
00:17:54,771 --> 00:18:00,267
And Moses said; Oh my people! If you have believed in Allah then put your trust in Him; if you are Muslims.

274
00:18:00,581 --> 00:18:01,541
He is preparing them.

275
00:18:01,774 --> 00:18:03,747
Put your trust in Allah; have Tawaqqul(توكل) in Allah.

276
00:18:04,067 --> 00:18:08,690
Because Musa(موسى) knows that this path is a path of difficulty and suffering.

277
00:18:09,117 --> 00:18:11,207
So he's telling his people you need to have Tawaqqul(توكل).

278
00:18:11,780 --> 00:18:14,073
And Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل), they said;

279
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:23,547
فَقَالُواْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ تَوَكَّلْنَا رَبَّنَا لَا تَجْعَلْنَا فِتْنَةً لِّلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ۝

280
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:27,050
They said; In Allah we put our trust; Our Lord!

281
00:18:27,378 --> 00:18:28,068
What does this mean?

282
00:18:28,088 --> 00:18:31,447
رَبَّنَا لَا تَجْعَلْنَا فِتْنَةً لِّلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ۝

283
00:18:31,467 --> 00:18:34,327
Oh Allah! Don't make us Fitnah(فِتْنَه) for the non-believers.

284
00:18:34,347 --> 00:18:38,349
The Mufassireen(مفسرين) give a few meanings to that one meaning they say is;

285
00:18:38,915 --> 00:18:40,169
لَا تَجْعَلْنَا فِتْنَةً

286
00:18:40,569 --> 00:18:48,644
Don't give the non-believers; the ability to make for us Fitnah(فِتْنَه) in our religion and drive us out of Islam.

287
00:18:49,431 --> 00:18:50,364
That's one meaning.

288
00:18:51,018 --> 00:18:53,694
So, they're asking Allah to give them; firmness on Sabr(صبر).

289
00:18:54,004 --> 00:18:58,641
So that, they would not lose under the oppression of Az-Zalimeen(الظالمين).

290
00:18:58,888 --> 00:19:04,074
Another meaning is; Don't make us the cause of their disbelief.

291
00:19:05,067 --> 00:19:07,391
Don't make us the cause of their disbelief.

292
00:19:07,957 --> 00:19:12,970
These oppressors or wrongdoers would see that, we are weak and poor and enslaved.

293
00:19:13,604 --> 00:19:17,356
And they would refuse and reject Islam because of that.

294
00:19:18,116 --> 00:19:24,156
So don't make us the cause for the disbelief of the disbelievers.

295
00:19:25,250 --> 00:19:25,890
And then they said;

296
00:19:25,910 --> 00:19:28,969
وَنَجِّنَا بِرَحْمَتِكَ مِنَ الْقَوْمِ الْكَافِرِينَ۝

297
00:19:29,491 --> 00:19:33,243
And save us by our mercy from the disbelieving folks.

298
00:19:33,930 --> 00:19:36,863
Musa(موسى) received Wahi(وحى) from Allah.

299
00:19:37,943 --> 00:19:43,642
Allah is telling him; mark the houses of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

300
00:19:44,102 --> 00:19:50,585
Mark them either with certain code or sign or have a certain flag on them

301
00:19:51,031 --> 00:19:55,621
or it could mean that, we need a map of where the houses of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) are.

302
00:19:55,681 --> 00:20:02,663
Regardless of what it means, the essence of this Ayah(آية) or the understanding that we get from this Ayah(آية) is that

303
00:20:02,703 --> 00:20:06,980
Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) they knew the houses of each other.

304
00:20:07,207 --> 00:20:13,819
Whether, it is with a certain mark or a flag or they knew the directions, anyway somehow they knew.

305
00:20:13,893 --> 00:20:20,281
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is telling Musa(موسى) tell your people to mark the houses in some way or another.

306
00:20:20,395 --> 00:20:23,975
The Tafseer(تفسير) give different meanings to that but Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

307
00:20:24,061 --> 00:20:29,175
وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰ وَأَخِيهِ أَن تَبَوَّءَا لِقَوْمِكُمَا بِمِصْرَ بُيُوتًا

308
00:20:29,677 --> 00:20:32,993
Allah says; And we inspired Musa(موسى) and his brother, saying;

309
00:20:33,153 --> 00:20:36,167
Take dwellings for your people in Egypt, this is one order.

310
00:20:36,187 --> 00:20:40,292
The another order, the second order that; Musa(موسى) received in this revelation is;

311
00:20:40,632 --> 00:20:44,025
وَٱجْعَلُواْ بُيُوتَكُمْ قِبْلَةً وَأَقِيمُواْ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۗ

312
00:20:44,519 --> 00:20:49,817
Make your houses, turn your houses into Masajid(مساجد), and establish Salah(صلاة).

313
00:20:50,457 --> 00:20:51,843
Turn your houses into Masajid(مساجد).

314
00:20:51,863 --> 00:20:52,550
What is a Masjid(مسجد)?

315
00:20:52,570 --> 00:20:55,772
The word Masjid(مسجد) is from Sujood(سجود).

316
00:20:56,152 --> 00:20:59,812
Masjid(مسجد) is a place, where you make a lot of Sujood(سجود).

317
00:21:00,138 --> 00:21:04,604
And that's why, our Worship places are called Masajid(مساجد), because we make a lot of Sujood(سجود) in them.

318
00:21:05,604 --> 00:21:14,468
So this means that, Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is telling Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) to make their houses centers of worship, centers of Sujood(سجود) to Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

319
00:21:14,635 --> 00:21:15,790
وَأَقِيمُواْ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۗ

320
00:21:15,884 --> 00:21:17,204
And established prayer.

321
00:21:17,370 --> 00:21:18,377
Why?

322
00:21:18,817 --> 00:21:20,552
Because difficult moments are lying ahead.

323
00:21:21,106 --> 00:21:24,689
Rasool Allah ﷺ; if he was facing difficulty, what would he do?

324
00:21:24,992 --> 00:21:25,779
He would pray.

325
00:21:26,886 --> 00:21:31,588
Whenever, Rasool Allah ﷺ would be in a difficult situation; he would immediately rush into Salah(صلاة).

326
00:21:32,381 --> 00:21:35,631
So, Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is telling Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); You need to prepare yourselves.

327
00:21:36,034 --> 00:21:42,577
And you need to make a lot of Sujood(سجود), and you need to turn your houses into places of Ibadah(عبادة), and you need to establish Salah(صلاة).

328
00:21:43,012 --> 00:21:44,492
وَأَقِيمُواْ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۗ

329
00:21:44,586 --> 00:21:45,619
And then in the end;

330
00:21:45,726 --> 00:21:47,006
وَبَشِّرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ۝

331
00:21:47,146 --> 00:21:49,911
And give the believers; the glad tidings; the victory is soon.

332
00:21:51,665 --> 00:21:52,591
وَبَشِّرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ۝

333
00:21:52,685 --> 00:21:54,118
Give them the glad tidings.

334
00:21:54,371 --> 00:21:58,591
Musa(موسى) made his Dua(دُعَا) against Firaun(فرعون).

335
00:21:59,457 --> 00:22:03,516
But he did not do it until, he exhausted all means possible.

336
00:22:04,423 --> 00:22:06,243
He used every possible mean.

337
00:22:06,569 --> 00:22:12,402
He was presented with all of our signs; but he disbelieved in them and rejected them.

338
00:22:13,255 --> 00:22:15,208
Musa(موسى) tried everything possible.

339
00:22:15,522 --> 00:22:19,379
Soft words; presenting him with nine Ayah(آية); one after another.

340
00:22:19,632 --> 00:22:23,398
Giving him Targheeb(ترغيب), by giving him Tarheeb(ترهيب), nothing worked with Firaun(فرعون).

341
00:22:23,625 --> 00:22:30,411
In the end, when Musa(موسى) used all possible means, then Musa(موسى) made the Dua(دُعَا) against Firaun(فرعون) and what did he say?

342
00:22:30,436 --> 00:22:44,483
وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ رَبَّنَا إِنَّكَ آتَيْتَ فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَأَهُ زِينَةً وَأَمْوَالًا فِي الْحَيَاةِ الدُّنْيَا رَبَّنَا

343
00:22:44,906 --> 00:22:48,653
رَبَّنَا لِيُضِلُّوا عَن سَبِيلِكَ ۖ

344
00:22:48,820 --> 00:22:56,605
Musa(موسى) said; Oh Allah! You have indeed bestowed on Firaun(فرعون) and his chiefs; splender and wealth in this life of this world.

345
00:22:57,033 --> 00:23:05,033
Musa(موسى) saying; Oh Allah! you have given Firaun(فرعون) a lot. And then, what did he Say?

رَبَّنَا لِيُضِلُّوا عَن سَبِيلِكَ ۖ

346
00:23:05,771 --> 00:23:09,631
Musa(موسى) is saying; They're using this wealth to mislead people from Your path.

347
00:23:10,644 --> 00:23:18,674
This wealth, which is in the hands of Firaun(فرعون) is not used for Your sake, but it is used against Your religion.

348
00:23:19,681 --> 00:23:22,681
رَبَّنَا اطْمِسْ عَلَىٰ أَمْوَالِهِمْ

349
00:23:22,834 --> 00:23:25,656
He said; Oh Allah! Destroy their wealth.

350
00:23:26,243 --> 00:23:31,490
This wealth which they have, which they are using against Islam and against Your religion.

351
00:23:31,516 --> 00:23:32,783
Oh Allah! Destroy it.

352
00:23:33,096 --> 00:23:34,969
اطْمِسْ عَلَىٰ أَمْوَالِهِمْ

353
00:23:35,215 --> 00:23:37,009
وَاشْدُدْ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ

354
00:23:37,115 --> 00:23:38,849
And harden their hearts.

355
00:23:39,269 --> 00:23:41,742
فَلَا يُؤْمِنُوا حَتَّىٰ يَرَوُا الْعَذَابَ الْأَلِيمَ۝

356
00:23:41,902 --> 00:23:44,964
So that, they will not believe until they see the painful torment.

357
00:23:45,297 --> 00:23:47,567
Musa(موسى) is making Dua(دُعَا); Don't guide Firaun(فرعون).

358
00:23:47,867 --> 00:23:49,374
Oh Allah! Do not guide him.

359
00:23:50,253 --> 00:23:53,023
Don't make him believe until, he sees the punishment and it's too late.

360
00:23:53,986 --> 00:23:57,405
It's an interesting Dua(دُعَا). We usually always make Dua(دُعَا); Oh Allah! Guide.

361
00:23:57,872 --> 00:24:00,052
Musa(موسى) over here is making a Dua(دُعَا);

362
00:24:00,472 --> 00:24:02,631
فَلَا يُؤْمِنُوا حَتَّىٰ يَرَوُا الْعَذَابَ الْأَلِيمَ۝

363
00:24:02,716 --> 00:24:07,857
Oh Allah! Don't make him believe until, he sees the painful punishment in front of his eyes, but then it's too late.

364
00:24:08,471 --> 00:24:10,830
This Dua(دُعَا) was not made in the first year or the second year.

365
00:24:10,850 --> 00:24:15,756
This Dua(دُعَا) was made when Musa(موسى) reached to the conclusion that, there is no hope in Firaun(فرعون).

366
00:24:16,549 --> 00:24:18,216
He tried every means possible.

367
00:24:18,576 --> 00:24:20,069
And he's making this Dua(دُعَا); why?

368
00:24:20,089 --> 00:24:28,678
Because he has seen that Firaun(فرعون) and the evil of Firaun(فرعون); it is going to cause the misleading of the believers.

369
00:24:29,558 --> 00:24:34,453
So the Maslaha(مصلحۃ), the interest is, in destroying Firaun(فرعون) and getting rid of him,

370
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:38,930
because he has become a cause of misguidance for the guided.

371
00:24:39,136 --> 00:24:47,384
So, in the end; Musa(موسى) and that's why, Musa(موسى) and Nuh(نوح) were the two Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) Rasool Allahﷺ said;

372
00:24:47,409 --> 00:24:50,203
Were strong and were harsh on the non believers.

373
00:24:50,550 --> 00:24:54,010
And then, who were the two, which were mild?

374
00:24:54,923 --> 00:24:55,830
Eesa(عيسى) and who?

375
00:24:56,156 --> 00:24:57,108
And Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم).

376
00:24:57,470 --> 00:25:01,030
Eesa(عيسى) and Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) and that's why, in one Hadith(حديث) Rasool Allah ﷺ says;

377
00:25:01,263 --> 00:25:04,478
That you Abu Bakr(ابوبكر), you are similar to Eesa(عيسى) and Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم)

378
00:25:04,612 --> 00:25:07,778
and you, Umar(عمر); You are similar to Musa(موسى) and Nuh(نوح).

379
00:25:08,018 --> 00:25:10,954
Because Nuh(نوح) has also made a Dua(دُعَا); Oh Allah! Destroy the non-believers.

380
00:25:11,114 --> 00:25:15,968
While, we know that; Sayidina Eesa(سيدنا عيسى) and Sayidina Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم); they always were giving another chance.

381
00:25:16,288 --> 00:25:17,321
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said;

382
00:25:17,374 --> 00:25:18,748
قَدْ أُجِيبَت دَّعْوَتُكُمَا

383
00:25:19,548 --> 00:25:23,210
Allah said; Your Dua(دُعَا), the Dua(دُعَا) of both of you was accepted.

384
00:25:24,017 --> 00:25:26,043
The Ayah(آية) before; who was making the Dua(دُعَا)?

385
00:25:26,637 --> 00:25:27,230
Musa(موسى).

386
00:25:27,363 --> 00:25:29,230
But in the Ayah(آية), the following it Ayah(آية) says;

387
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:31,096
قَالَ قَدْ أُجِيبَت دَّعْوَتُكُمَا

388
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:33,871
Allah said; Verily, the invocation of you both is accepted.

389
00:25:34,538 --> 00:25:36,168
So, why does it say; the two of you?

390
00:25:36,188 --> 00:25:40,043
The Mufassireen(مفسرين) say that, Musa(موسى) was making the Dua(دُعَا) and Haroon(هارون) was saying; Ameen(آمين).

391
00:25:40,430 --> 00:25:43,077
That's the explanation that the Mufassireen(مفسرين) give.

392
00:25:43,230 --> 00:25:45,217
Therefore, the Dua(دُعَا) was actually done by both.

393
00:25:45,630 --> 00:25:48,782
Even though, Musa(موسى) was the one who was saying it, but Haroon(هارون) was saying; Ameen(آمين).

394
00:25:48,915 --> 00:25:51,662
And that's why, when we are in Salah(صلاة); the Imam(اِمَام) is making Dua(دُعَا);

395
00:25:52,009 --> 00:25:53,624
it is all of us who are making Dua(دُعَا) together.

396
00:25:53,644 --> 00:25:57,344
Because when you say; Ameen(آمين) and that's why we say after Al-Fatiha(الفاتحه); Ameen(آمين).

397
00:25:57,691 --> 00:26:00,484
What is the Dua(دُعَا) in Al-Fatiha(الفاتحه) that we're saying Ameen(آمين) for?

398
00:26:01,139 --> 00:26:02,326
اهْدِنَا الصِّرَاطَ الْمُسْتَقِيمَ۝

399
00:26:02,346 --> 00:26:03,779
Guide us to the straight path.

400
00:26:04,179 --> 00:26:06,622
So, all of us say; Ameen(آمين) which means; Oh Allah! Accept.

401
00:26:06,922 --> 00:26:18,057
وَأَوْحَيْنَا إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰ أَنْ أَسْرِ بِعِبَادِي إِنَّكُم مُّتَّبَعُونَ۝

402
00:26:18,477 --> 00:26:23,553
And we inspired to Musa(موسى) saying; Take away my slaves by night, verily you will be pursued.

403
00:26:23,606 --> 00:26:25,473
Now you understand, why the houses were marked?

404
00:26:25,973 --> 00:26:29,419
Because the order of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) to leave will be sudden.

405
00:26:29,799 --> 00:26:33,305
So Musa(موسى) needs to know, where the homes of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) are located.

406
00:26:33,372 --> 00:26:35,991
So that, they can immediately leave when the order of Allah comes.

407
00:26:36,918 --> 00:26:39,304
Because Firaun(فرعون) was preventing them from leaving.

408
00:26:39,464 --> 00:26:41,810
Firaun(فرعون) has taking them as slaves and servants.

409
00:26:42,036 --> 00:26:44,516
So he does not want to release Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

410
00:26:44,836 --> 00:26:49,969
One of the things that Musa(موسى) has called Firaun(فرعون) to, from the first meeting that he had with him;

411
00:26:50,322 --> 00:26:52,062
أَنْ أَرْسِلْ مَعَنَا بَنِي إِسْرَائِيلَ۝

412
00:26:52,089 --> 00:26:54,325
Send with me; the children of Israel(اسرائيل); Release them.

413
00:26:54,802 --> 00:27:00,867
So when the order of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى was revealed for Musa(موسى); to leave with the children of Israel(اسرائيل).

414
00:27:01,121 --> 00:27:04,393
They have to have a plan, already prepared.

415
00:27:04,593 --> 00:27:08,200
So that, they could leave suddenly, without Firaun(فرعون) knowing.

416
00:27:09,080 --> 00:27:13,866
So the commandment from Allahسُبحانه وتعالى came; in the form of revelation to Syedina Musa(سيدنا موسى);

417
00:27:14,266 --> 00:27:14,906
وَأَوْحَيْنَا

418
00:27:14,926 --> 00:27:16,898
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى revealed the order to him;

419
00:27:17,305 --> 00:27:18,538
أَنْ أَسْرِ بِعِبَادِي

420
00:27:18,811 --> 00:27:20,955
Asri Bi'ibadi(أَسْرِ بِعِبَادِي) means; leave at night-time.

421
00:27:21,598 --> 00:27:23,564
So they left at-night time; all of them.

422
00:27:23,830 --> 00:27:26,890
We don't know exactly, how many they were.

423
00:27:27,797 --> 00:27:30,724
But the Mufassireen(مفسرين) they say that;

424
00:27:30,784 --> 00:27:37,949
they were 600,000 fighters, and then add to that the woman and the children and the old.

425
00:27:38,729 --> 00:27:40,016
So this was a huge nation.

426
00:27:41,009 --> 00:27:44,816
And they say, that they have been in Egypt for a little over 400 years.

427
00:27:45,305 --> 00:27:48,007
Because the Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); how did they get into Egypt?

428
00:27:48,254 --> 00:27:52,921
With Yusufعليه السلام and his brothers; Al-Asbaat(الاسباط), his 11 Brothers.

429
00:27:53,161 --> 00:27:58,477
They lived in Egypt and they multiplied; and within 400 years, they were a nation of 600,000.

430
00:27:58,733 --> 00:28:01,433
So this nation left in at night-time.

431
00:28:01,939 --> 00:28:07,472
The news was conveyed to Firaun(فرعون), his spies obviously knew about it.

432
00:28:08,065 --> 00:28:10,799
So they told Firaun(فرعون) about it.

433
00:28:10,885 --> 00:28:12,079
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

434
00:28:12,099 --> 00:28:14,241
فَأَرْسَلَ فِرْعَوْنُ فِى ٱلْمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ۝

435
00:28:14,618 --> 00:28:16,881
Then Pharaoh sent callers to all cities.

436
00:28:16,961 --> 00:28:19,411
إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ لَشِرْذِمَةٌ قَلِيلُونَ۝

437
00:28:19,535 --> 00:28:21,737
Verily, these indeed are but a small band.

438
00:28:21,817 --> 00:28:23,284
وَإِنَّهُمْ لَنَا لَغَآئِظُونَ۝

439
00:28:23,517 --> 00:28:27,122
And verily, they have done, what has enraged us.

440
00:28:27,142 --> 00:28:28,856
وَإِنَّا لَجَمِيعٌ حَٰذِرُونَ۝

441
00:28:29,029 --> 00:28:32,436
But we are all assembled; amply fore-warned.

442
00:28:32,456 --> 00:28:33,592
Let's look at this Ayaat(آيات);

443
00:28:34,546 --> 00:28:39,199
Firaun(فرعون) is now mobilizing his army to follow Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

444
00:28:39,372 --> 00:28:40,046
Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) left.

445
00:28:40,212 --> 00:28:42,521
Firaun(فرعون) is gathering and collecting his soldiers.

446
00:28:43,294 --> 00:28:44,648
And look at, what Firaun(فرعون) says?

447
00:28:45,054 --> 00:28:52,040
إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ لَشِرْذِمَةٌ قَلِيلُونَ۝

448
00:28:52,267 --> 00:28:54,490
These are small group that's number one.

449
00:28:54,583 --> 00:28:55,076
He said;

450
00:28:55,183 --> 00:28:59,836
وَإِنَّهُمْ لَنَا لَغَآئِظُونَ۝

451
00:29:00,102 --> 00:29:01,792
And they are enraging us;

452
00:29:02,049 --> 00:29:03,757
وَإِنَّا لَجَمِيعٌ حَٰذِرُونَ۝

453
00:29:03,781 --> 00:29:06,112
But we are all going to be cautious.

454
00:29:07,528 --> 00:29:09,842
Firaun(فرعون); even though, he's saying; they're a small group.

455
00:29:10,222 --> 00:29:12,451
But he's saying that, we're going to prepare for this a lot.

456
00:29:12,944 --> 00:29:16,304
And we're going to gather, all of our army for this purpose.

457
00:29:16,917 --> 00:29:20,441
I find that, a little bit similar to the situation in the world today.

458
00:29:21,130 --> 00:29:27,709
They always say that Islamic fundamentalists are few, it's not a lot of people.

459
00:29:27,949 --> 00:29:34,167
Nevertheless, they're having high profile meetings all over the world to counter their effect.

460
00:29:34,841 --> 00:29:42,034
And you find that the biggest leaders of the world will come together to discuss the children who are throwing rocks in Falastine(فلسطين).

461
00:29:43,194 --> 00:29:46,313
Kids; who are throwing stones in Falastine(فلسطين).

462
00:29:46,453 --> 00:29:52,043
You find the presidents and the kings of the world; coming and discussing; how can we deal with this problem?

463
00:29:52,260 --> 00:29:52,753
شِرْذِمَةٌ

464
00:29:52,773 --> 00:29:55,476
They say; they are small group, kids; children.

465
00:29:56,486 --> 00:29:58,087
Very similar to what Firaun(فرعون) did.

466
00:29:58,294 --> 00:30:00,007
Even though, it's a small group.

467
00:30:00,380 --> 00:30:06,069
But Allahسُبحانه وتعالى puts the fear in the hearts of enemies from the believers, even if it’s a small group.

468
00:30:06,949 --> 00:30:08,306
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

469
00:30:08,389 --> 00:30:10,559
فَأَخْرَجْنَاهُمْ مِنْ جَنَّاتٍ وَعُيُونٍ۝

470
00:30:11,406 --> 00:30:13,226
Firaun(فرعون) was gathering all of his army.

471
00:30:13,299 --> 00:30:19,292
Notice; Firaun(فرعون) was gathering; not half of it, not 75%; he was gathering all of his army.

472
00:30:20,178 --> 00:30:21,274
But Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

473
00:30:21,294 --> 00:30:23,474
فَأَخْرَجْنَاهُمْ مِنْ جَنَّاتٍ وَعُيُونٍ۝

474
00:30:23,681 --> 00:30:26,074
We expelled them, from gardens and springs.

475
00:30:26,227 --> 00:30:27,321
Allah was expelling them.

476
00:30:28,007 --> 00:30:31,136
Firaun(فرعون) was gathering all of his army to follow Musa(موسى).

477
00:30:31,363 --> 00:30:36,063
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى wanted Firaun(فرعون) to gather all of his army so that, they can all be expelled.

478
00:30:37,490 --> 00:30:39,084
وَكُنُوزٍ وَمَقَامٍ كَرِيمٍ۝

479
00:30:39,164 --> 00:30:41,404
Treasures and every kind of honorable place.

480
00:30:41,611 --> 00:30:43,677
كَذَٰلِكَ وَأَوْرَثْنَٰهَا بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ۝

481
00:30:43,844 --> 00:30:47,310
Thus, we cause the children of Israel(اسرائيل) to inherit them.

482
00:30:48,403 --> 00:30:50,036
فَأَتْبَعُوهُم مُّشْرِقِينَ۝

483
00:30:50,311 --> 00:30:51,890
They followed them at sunrise.

484
00:30:52,456 --> 00:30:56,256
Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) they left at dark, at night.

485
00:30:56,863 --> 00:30:59,111
Firaun(فرعون) and his army were ready by the morning.

486
00:30:59,518 --> 00:31:06,491
Firaun(فرعون) and his army have better equipment, stronger weapons, more powerful weapons, larger army,

487
00:31:06,651 --> 00:31:08,111
so they were able to catch up.

488
00:31:08,431 --> 00:31:11,478
They were faster than Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

489
00:31:12,271 --> 00:31:14,227
Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) were traveling East.

490
00:31:14,520 --> 00:31:16,533
Firaun(فرعون) his army were following them.

491
00:31:18,567 --> 00:31:21,826
Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل), they reach to the Red Sea.

492
00:31:23,439 --> 00:31:28,073
Actually, they were moving and Firaun(فرعون) is behind them, following them

493
00:31:28,439 --> 00:31:40,459
the group of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل), the ones who are towards the end.

494
00:31:40,545 --> 00:31:44,725
They started seeing in the back, in the horizon, Firaun(فرعون) and his army.

495
00:31:46,152 --> 00:31:51,843
And they kept on trying to move as fast as they can but then suddenly, the Red Sea was in front of them, so they couldn't move.

496
00:31:52,423 --> 00:31:55,875
And now Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) are looking to their back,

497
00:31:56,282 --> 00:32:01,691
and they see that Firaun(فرعون) is coming closer and closer, and they look to the front, and they saw, they find the Red Sea.

498
00:32:02,078 --> 00:32:03,791
What was the reaction of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل)?

499
00:32:04,018 --> 00:32:14,578
فَلَمَّا تَرَٰٓءَا ٱلْجَمْعَانِ قَالَ أَصْحَٰبُ مُوسَىٰٓ إِنَّا لَمُدْرَكُونَ۝

500
00:32:14,882 --> 00:32:19,197
And when the two hosts saw each other, the people of Musa(موسى) said;

501
00:32:19,304 --> 00:32:21,789
We are surely going to be overtaken.

502
00:32:23,211 --> 00:32:27,071
The sea is in front of us, Firaun(فرعون) is behind us, we're dead.

503
00:32:27,376 --> 00:32:30,558
And it is said that, there are mountains on the side, there is no way, we can go.

504
00:32:31,158 --> 00:32:33,593
It is said that Musa(موسى) was towards the end.

505
00:32:34,213 --> 00:32:44,473
So Musa(موسى) and Haroon(هارون) and Yusha Bin Noon(يوشع بن نون) they made it all the way to the front to the sea and they stood there.

506
00:32:45,122 --> 00:32:49,418
Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) are looking at Firaun(فرعون), he's coming closer and closer.

507
00:32:49,731 --> 00:32:51,968
And they're putting pressure on Musa(موسى), What are you doing?

508
00:32:52,071 --> 00:33:00,138
They're going to overtake us, they're gonna kill us, the seas is in front of us, Firaun(فرعون) is towards our back, mountains on the side.

509
00:33:00,425 --> 00:33:01,992
Musa(موسى) does not believe all of this.

510
00:33:02,318 --> 00:33:02,725
He said;

511
00:33:02,745 --> 00:33:03,405
كَلَّا ۖ

512
00:33:03,425 --> 00:33:04,085
No!

513
00:33:04,625 --> 00:33:05,862
إِنَّ مَعِيَ رَبِّي سَيَهْدِينِ۝

514
00:33:05,882 --> 00:33:07,147
Allah will guide me.

515
00:33:07,667 --> 00:33:11,604
He does not believe what he sees, he does not believe what he hears,

516
00:33:11,747 --> 00:33:14,807
but he believes the unseen, which he can neither hear nor see.

517
00:33:15,993 --> 00:33:21,977
The sea is in front of him, the army of Firaun(فرعون) is towards his back, mountains on the side, where can he go?

518
00:33:22,500 --> 00:33:23,606
What can he do?

519
00:33:24,420 --> 00:33:25,226
Musa(موسى) saying;

520
00:33:25,246 --> 00:33:25,853
كَلَّا ۖ

521
00:33:25,873 --> 00:33:26,543
No!

522
00:33:26,806 --> 00:33:28,125
إِنَّ مَعِيَ رَبِّي سَيَهْدِينِ۝

523
00:33:28,145 --> 00:33:29,165
I believe Allah.

524
00:33:29,339 --> 00:33:30,785
I believe in Allah, that He will guide me.

525
00:33:30,805 --> 00:33:33,352
Allah has promised me, I believe in the promise of Allah.

526
00:33:34,259 --> 00:33:35,399
Firaun(فرعون) is closing in

527
00:33:35,419 --> 00:33:41,583
and he's getting closer and closer and they can start seeing the individual soldiers of the army of Firaun(فرعون) right towards their back

528
00:33:41,710 --> 00:33:46,467
and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) are putting pressure on Musa(موسى) and they're telling him; What are you doing?

529
00:33:46,634 --> 00:33:49,114
And imagine the situation of the leadership in that situation.

530
00:33:49,454 --> 00:33:52,666
He's telling them; Allah has promised me that, He will guide us.

531
00:33:52,760 --> 00:33:56,953
And they see Firaun(فرعون) is catching up on them; and he's still telling them; No!

532
00:33:57,046 --> 00:33:58,079
إِنَّ مَعِيَ رَبِّي سَيَهْدِينِ۝

533
00:33:58,099 --> 00:33:58,986
I believe in Allah.

534
00:33:59,112 --> 00:34:03,092
I don't believe, what you're saying and I don't believe that Firaun(فرعون) will be able to overtake us.

535
00:34:03,426 --> 00:34:05,024
Test from Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

536
00:34:06,464 --> 00:34:10,051
In that difficult moment, that is when the victory of Allah descends.

537
00:34:11,204 --> 00:34:17,066
When things become very difficult and People start failing, like what happened with Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل)?

538
00:34:17,086 --> 00:34:18,455
They failed in this test.

539
00:34:18,828 --> 00:34:20,512
It is a test for the believers

540
00:34:20,706 --> 00:34:24,112
and the ones who were able to pass it are; Musa(موسى) and Haroon(هارون) and Yusha Bin Noon(يوشع بن نون)

541
00:34:24,252 --> 00:34:27,818
and some of the other elders and leaders of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

542
00:34:28,091 --> 00:34:30,171
Then, Allahسُبحانه وتعالى revealed his order;

543
00:34:30,218 --> 00:34:44,217
فَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنِ ٱضْرِب بِّعَصَاكَ ٱلْبَحْرَ ۖ فَٱنفَلَقَ فَكَانَ كُلُّ فِرْقٍۢ كَٱلطَّوْدِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ۝

544
00:34:44,639 --> 00:34:49,453
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said; And then, we revealed to Musa(موسى) hit the sea with your stick.

545
00:34:50,839 --> 00:34:53,589
Musa(موسى) hit the sea with the stick.

546
00:34:53,649 --> 00:34:54,869
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

547
00:34:54,889 --> 00:34:57,489
فَكَانَ كُلُّ فِرْقٍۢ كَٱلطَّوْدِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ۝

548
00:34:58,096 --> 00:35:03,338
The sea split up and every portion was like a huge mountain.

549
00:35:04,238 --> 00:35:09,894
Musa(موسى) in front of his eyes, is seeing this water spin up and break into two pieces

550
00:35:10,080 --> 00:35:15,179
and then stand up like two huge mountains in front of his eyes and in front of the eyes of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

551
00:35:15,313 --> 00:35:17,526
They're seeing another Ayah(آية); In front of their eyes.

552
00:35:17,653 --> 00:35:19,399
And then Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

553
00:35:19,766 --> 00:35:22,275
Yabasan(يَبَسًا); in another Ayah(آية) in Surat-Taha(سورة طه)

554
00:35:22,621 --> 00:35:27,203
The bottom, the basin of the sea is wet, it's wet, there's water in it and it's mud.

555
00:35:27,417 --> 00:35:28,403
How can they walk on it?

556
00:35:28,457 --> 00:35:30,323
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى made it dry.

557
00:35:31,163 --> 00:35:36,285
Not only did it split; did the ocean, sea split, but also the basin became dry.

558
00:35:36,343 --> 00:35:39,656
It is said that, some wind came and took all of the moisture away from it.

559
00:35:39,729 --> 00:35:41,349
So it was firm; Yabasan(يَبَسًا).

560
00:35:41,374 --> 00:35:45,579
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says; Dry; prepared for Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

561
00:35:46,115 --> 00:35:50,692
Musa(موسى) stood and he made all of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) pass through.

562
00:35:51,412 --> 00:35:54,318
And then, he was the last one to go.

563
00:35:54,598 --> 00:36:02,051
When they reached to the other side, Musa(موسى), he hit the sea with his stick; because he wanted to close it.

564
00:36:03,071 --> 00:36:04,860
He hit the sea with his stick.

565
00:36:04,973 --> 00:36:07,207
What divided the sea?

566
00:36:07,493 --> 00:36:08,323
The stick.

567
00:36:09,267 --> 00:36:11,450
But, is it really the stick, that divided the sea?

568
00:36:11,899 --> 00:36:13,362
It is Allahسُبحانه وتعالى, it's not stick.

569
00:36:13,402 --> 00:36:15,768
If you take a stick and hit it with the water; what will happen?

570
00:36:15,788 --> 00:36:17,802
You'll splash water; you will just wet your clothes.

571
00:36:18,088 --> 00:36:23,148
It is not the stick that divided the sea; it is the will of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى that divided the sea.

572
00:36:23,601 --> 00:36:25,674
So why did Musa(موسى) have to use the stick?

573
00:36:27,381 --> 00:36:31,337
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى will not give you victory until you do your part.

574
00:36:31,637 --> 00:36:35,390
And if the most you could do is; hit the water with your stick, then do it.

575
00:36:35,637 --> 00:36:38,410
The victory of Allah will not come until you do your part.

576
00:36:39,004 --> 00:36:42,024
But Allahسُبحانه وتعالى wants Musa(موسى) to do his part.

577
00:36:42,324 --> 00:36:47,159
And we are complaining that, the victory is not here and the reason is; because we're not doing our part.

578
00:36:48,953 --> 00:36:56,252
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is gonna perform miracles and is gonna give His victory to the ones who He loves; to the Awliya(اولياء) of Allah,

579
00:36:56,372 --> 00:36:58,355
but they need to do their part.

580
00:36:59,335 --> 00:37:01,920
Rasool Allah ﷺ in the Battle of Badr(بدر).

581
00:37:02,094 --> 00:37:08,160
He put the believers in ranks, he fixed them together, he did everything that is humanly possible and then, what did he do?

582
00:37:08,373 --> 00:37:10,153
He went on a hill and he started making Dua(دُعَا).

583
00:37:10,980 --> 00:37:12,502
He did everything that he can do.

584
00:37:12,662 --> 00:37:14,382
And now, it's time to ask help from Allah.

585
00:37:14,435 --> 00:37:17,302
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى sent down 2000 angels to fight with them.

586
00:37:17,902 --> 00:37:24,251
They had to go out, and they had to take all preparations possible, everything humanly possible and then,

587
00:37:24,358 --> 00:37:28,757
when they fulfill that; then they make Tawaqqul(توكل) in Allahسُبحانه وتعالى and Allah will give the victory.

588
00:37:29,097 --> 00:37:30,857
So Allah wants Musa(موسى) to do his part.

589
00:37:31,097 --> 00:37:33,357
The best he can do is; hit the water with a stick.

590
00:37:33,737 --> 00:37:37,248
Now, Musa(موسى) on the other side, thinks that the stick can close it again.

591
00:37:37,345 --> 00:37:40,572
So he is hitting the water with his stick; and he's splashing water but it's not moving.

592
00:37:40,745 --> 00:37:41,560
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said;

593
00:37:41,580 --> 00:37:43,160
وَٱتْرُكِ ٱلْبَحْرَ رَهْوًا ۖ

594
00:37:43,207 --> 00:37:44,787
Leave the sea alone.

595
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:48,150
Allah told Musa(موسى), Leave the sea alone.

596
00:37:48,357 --> 00:37:50,217
وَٱتْرُكِ ٱلْبَحْرَ رَهْوًا ۖ

597
00:37:50,543 --> 00:37:51,273
Why?

598
00:37:51,453 --> 00:37:53,863
Why did Musa(موسى) want to close the sea?

599
00:37:54,133 --> 00:37:56,323
To prevent Firaun(فرعون) from coming.

600
00:37:56,782 --> 00:37:59,048
He's planning, Musa(موسى) is planning.

601
00:37:59,275 --> 00:38:00,435
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى told him;

602
00:38:00,455 --> 00:38:01,918
وَٱتْرُكِ ٱلْبَحْرَ رَهْوًا ۖ

603
00:38:01,941 --> 00:38:03,534
Leave the sea alone.

604
00:38:03,714 --> 00:38:04,014
Why?

605
00:38:04,034 --> 00:38:05,081
إِنَّهُمْ جُندٌ مُّغْرَقُونَ۝

606
00:38:05,101 --> 00:38:06,504
Because they are going to drown.

607
00:38:06,674 --> 00:38:11,641
After all of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) passed, and Musa(موسى) passed.

608
00:38:12,797 --> 00:38:16,053
Firaun(فرعون) and his army, they went through the basin.

609
00:38:16,613 --> 00:38:23,590
All of them; and when all of the army of Firaun(فرعون); when all of them was on the basin of the sea;

610
00:38:23,730 --> 00:38:26,603
all of them; from Firaun(فرعون) to the last soldier;

611
00:38:27,043 --> 00:38:31,059
then Allahسُبحانه وتعالى told the water to return to its natural state of water again.

612
00:38:31,812 --> 00:38:40,601
And it closed on Firaun(فرعون) and his army, because the state of water change for temporary moment.

613
00:38:40,765 --> 00:38:41,718
Water is water.

614
00:38:41,945 --> 00:38:45,707
But Allahسُبحانه وتعالى made it change for a while.

615
00:38:46,313 --> 00:38:48,303
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى gave it different qualities

616
00:38:48,510 --> 00:38:52,717
and then Allahسُبحانه وتعالى told the water to return to its natural state of being water again.

617
00:38:53,383 --> 00:38:58,369
And Allahسُبحانه وتعالى destroyed Firaun(فرعون) with one of his soldiers, and that's an interesting soldier.

618
00:38:58,389 --> 00:39:01,358
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى destroyed Firaun(فرعون) with the source of life.

619
00:39:02,378 --> 00:39:06,211
Water which is the source of life, Allahسُبحانه وتعالى can use it as a soldier.

620
00:39:07,718 --> 00:39:08,795
So, it destroyed Firaun(فرعون).

621
00:39:08,820 --> 00:39:10,567
And it is says in the Tafseer(تفسير) that;

622
00:39:10,607 --> 00:39:17,156
the body of Firaun(فرعون) was spinning up and down in the water, in front of the eyes of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل)

623
00:39:17,376 --> 00:39:21,409
so that, they can see the fate of the enemy of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى the tyrant Firaun(فرعون).

624
00:39:22,978 --> 00:39:23,605
Firaun(فرعون) who said;

625
00:39:23,625 --> 00:39:24,805
أَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَى۝

626
00:39:25,258 --> 00:39:26,321
I am your highest Lord.

627
00:39:26,591 --> 00:39:28,231
وَمَا عَلِمْتُ لَكُم مِّنْ إِلَٰهٍ غَيْرِي

628
00:39:28,445 --> 00:39:32,750
I don't know that you have any other god, but me, was drowning in front of their eyes.

629
00:39:32,810 --> 00:39:35,501
And now, the fulfillment of the Dua(دُعَا) of Musa(موسى);

630
00:39:36,181 --> 00:39:42,330
When Firaun(فرعون) saw the punishment of Allah, Firaun(فرعون) raised up his finger and he said;

631
00:39:42,844 --> 00:39:49,249
ءَامَنتُ أَنَّهُۥ لَآ إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِىٓ ءَامَنَتْ بِهِۦ بَنُوٓاْ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ وَأَنَا۠ مِنَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ۝

632
00:39:49,547 --> 00:39:54,612
I believe; that there is no god; but the God of the children of Israel(اسرائيل) and I'm a Muslim.

633
00:39:55,852 --> 00:39:57,149
He believed in Islam.

634
00:39:57,845 --> 00:39:59,985
But he believed when it was too late.

635
00:40:00,359 --> 00:40:01,768
Because Rasool Allah ﷺ says;

636
00:40:01,808 --> 00:40:03,868
تَعرَّفْ إلى اللهِ في الرَّخاء يَعْرِفْك في الشِّدَّةِ

637
00:40:04,054 --> 00:40:08,844
Remember Allahسُبحانه وتعالى in moments of ease, Allah will remember you in moments of difficulty.

638
00:40:09,564 --> 00:40:11,891
Firaun(فرعون) did not remember Allah in moments of ease,

639
00:40:12,158 --> 00:40:13,951
he had wealth, he did not remember Allah,

640
00:40:14,191 --> 00:40:15,865
he had health, he did not remember Allah,

641
00:40:15,885 --> 00:40:17,725
he had life, he did not remember Allah,

642
00:40:17,878 --> 00:40:19,790
he had power, he did not remember Allah,

643
00:40:19,936 --> 00:40:21,736
he had youth, he did not remember Allah.

644
00:40:21,916 --> 00:40:27,612
But now, when he's facing death, when he was seeing the angels of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى descending on him.

645
00:40:27,779 --> 00:40:28,826
He said; I believe.

646
00:40:28,999 --> 00:40:30,256
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said;

647
00:40:30,399 --> 00:40:39,568
آلْآنَ وَقَدْ عَصَيْتَ قَبْلُ وَكُنتَ مِنَ الْمُفْسِدِينَ۝

648
00:40:39,941 --> 00:40:43,701
Now, you want to believe when you have committed corruption before;

649
00:40:43,841 --> 00:40:46,823
when you have disbelief before and you have committed corruption.

650
00:40:47,083 --> 00:40:50,543
اَلْيَوْمَ نُنَجِّيكَ بِبَدَنِكَ لِتَكُونَ لِمَنْ خَلْفَكَ آيَةً ۚ

651
00:40:50,770 --> 00:40:55,616
We will save your body and preserver today, so that you could be assigned for the people be after you.

652
00:40:56,342 --> 00:40:58,336
وَإِنَّ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ النَّاسِ عَنْ آيَاتِنَا لَغَافِلُونَ۝

653
00:40:58,361 --> 00:41:00,476
Most of the people are unaware of our signs.

654
00:41:01,309 --> 00:41:03,977
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said; Your Tobah(توبة) is not accepted.

655
00:41:04,224 --> 00:41:09,531
When the soul is already coming out and you see the angels in front of your eyes, it's too late.

656
00:41:10,011 --> 00:41:13,370
Jibreel عليه السلام came to Muhammadﷺ and said;

657
00:41:13,490 --> 00:41:19,748
If you have just seen me, when Firaun(فرعون) was drowning, and I was stuffing his mouth with mud.

658
00:41:20,454 --> 00:41:22,908
So that the mercy of Allah would not come on him.

659
00:41:23,188 --> 00:41:26,481
Look at, how much not only Musa(موسى) hated Firaun(فرعون);

660
00:41:26,501 --> 00:41:30,921
even Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل); Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) said that, he was stuffing dirt in the mouth of Firaun(فرعون).

661
00:41:30,941 --> 00:41:31,934
When he saw that, he wants to say;

662
00:41:31,954 --> 00:41:32,347
لَا إلَهَ إلاَّ اللَّه

663
00:41:32,367 --> 00:41:36,684
He started stuffing that dirt in his mouth; so that, the mercy would not come on this man.

664
00:41:37,024 --> 00:41:39,231
You can see that, this man was unbelievable.

665
00:41:39,591 --> 00:41:40,733
He was a tyrant

666
00:41:40,993 --> 00:41:43,756
and for Musa(موسى) to make such a Dua(دُعَا) against him

667
00:41:44,096 --> 00:41:45,366
and to say; Oh Allah! Don't guide him.

668
00:41:45,386 --> 00:41:52,466
And for Jibreel عليه السلام, the angel who would come with Al-Wahi(الوحى) from Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء)

669
00:41:52,759 --> 00:41:55,897
Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) is stuffing the dirt in his mouth so that he cannot speak.

670
00:41:57,751 --> 00:42:01,730
That is how bad the tyranny of Firaun(فرعون) was.

671
00:42:03,350 --> 00:42:05,297
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى destroyed Firaun(فرعون)

672
00:42:06,390 --> 00:42:07,693
and Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

673
00:42:07,713 --> 00:42:09,953
Today we will preserve your body.

674
00:42:10,260 --> 00:42:11,037
Why?

675
00:42:11,887 --> 00:42:14,039
So that you can be assigned for the people after you.

676
00:42:14,825 --> 00:42:21,455
The body of Firaun(فرعون) is being carried from one place to another around the world; mummified.

677
00:42:22,344 --> 00:42:24,404
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى has saved that body.

678
00:42:24,584 --> 00:42:27,552
And one of the researchers said; they made some research on the body of Firaun(فرعون);

679
00:42:27,572 --> 00:42:30,312
they found a very high concentration of salt in it.

680
00:42:30,966 --> 00:42:33,786
He drowned in salt water.

681
00:42:35,519 --> 00:42:39,078
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said that, We preserve the body of Firaun(فرعون);

682
00:42:40,178 --> 00:42:43,358
not to show you the glory of the Firaunic civilization,

683
00:42:44,311 --> 00:42:52,187
not for you to put him in a museum and you go and visit to see the magnificent heritage of Firaun(فرعون),

684
00:42:53,727 --> 00:42:59,873
not to go and take pictures of the body of Firaun(فرعون) to show how great that civilization was.

685
00:43:00,369 --> 00:43:07,134
Firaun(فرعون) who was the worst; whom Allahسُبحانه وتعالى kept his body so that it would be a sign for us.

686
00:43:07,441 --> 00:43:16,053
The people are treating his body and his existence, the exact opposite way of how it was intended.

687
00:43:16,513 --> 00:43:19,186
And that's why Allahسُبحانه وتعالى closes this Ayah(آية) with;

688
00:43:19,446 --> 00:43:21,705
وَلكِنَّ اَكْثَرَ النَّاسِ عَنْ آيَاتِنَا لَغَافِلُونَ۝

689
00:43:22,133 --> 00:43:24,445
But most of the people are unaware of our signs.

690
00:43:24,618 --> 00:43:27,557
People in the world today are unaware of the sign of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

691
00:43:27,930 --> 00:43:31,517
Firaun(فرعون) was left behind to be a reminder for us, what will happen to Al-Kafirin(الكافرين).

692
00:43:31,784 --> 00:43:34,214
This is the end result; that is, what will happen to them.

693
00:43:35,660 --> 00:43:40,019
There's something that I want to mention about Musa(موسى) and Firaun(فرعون).

694
00:43:41,633 --> 00:43:49,002
From the people of Firaun(فرعون); very few followed the Da'wah(دعوة) of Syedina Musa(سيدنا موسى).

695
00:43:50,262 --> 00:43:54,081
One of them was Momin-Al-Firaun(مومن ال فرعون);

696
00:43:54,494 --> 00:43:57,224
and his story is mentioned in Qur'an and it's a long story.

697
00:43:58,254 --> 00:44:03,703
And his story In sha Allah(ان شاالله) we could talk about it in a separate series about Al-Qass-Al-Qur'an(القص القرآن); The stories of Qur'an.

698
00:44:04,577 --> 00:44:09,320
 And then, there's also Asiyah Imra'atu Firaun(آسيه اِمْرَأَتُ فِرْعَوْنَ); who believed.

699
00:44:09,840 --> 00:44:11,955
Asiyah(آسيه); the wife of Firaun(فرعون).

700
00:44:13,015 --> 00:44:18,890
She believed in Allahسُبحانه وتعالى and the message of Syedina Musa(سيدنا موسى).

701
00:44:19,697 --> 00:44:25,373
And Asiyah(آسيه) is the one who raised up; Syedina Musa(سيدنا موسى); so for him; she was like a second mother.

702
00:44:25,833 --> 00:44:33,323
And Asiyah(آسيه); Allahسُبحانه وتعالى talked about her in Qur'an and Rasool Allah ﷺ also mentioned her in few Ahadith(احاديث).

703
00:44:33,495 --> 00:44:34,925
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

704
00:44:35,175 --> 00:44:44,557
وَضَرَبَ ٱللَّهُ مَثَلًا لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ ٱمْرَأَتَ فِرْعَوْنَ إِذْ قَالَتْ رَبِّ ٱبْنِ لِى عِندَكَ بَيْتًا فِى ٱلْجَنَّةِ

705
00:44:44,757 --> 00:44:51,456
 وَنَجِّنِى مِن فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِۦ وَنَجِّنِى مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ۝

706
00:44:51,854 --> 00:44:55,616
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى talks about the wife of Firaun(فرعون).

707
00:44:56,496 --> 00:44:58,873
And she made a Dua(دُعَا) to Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

708
00:44:59,263 --> 00:45:00,778
It's an interesting Dua(دُعَا). She said;

709
00:45:00,798 --> 00:45:02,392
قَالَتْ رَبِّ ٱبْنِ لِى عِندَكَ بَيْتًا فِى ٱلْجَنَّة

710
00:45:02,412 --> 00:45:04,152
Oh Allah! Built for me a house in Jannah(جنة).

711
00:45:05,078 --> 00:45:08,317
You might be amazed; why did she specifically asked for house in Jannah(جنة)?

712
00:45:08,537 --> 00:45:11,114
Why specifically a house?

713
00:45:11,510 --> 00:45:16,067
If you would look at her situation, that she would lived in; then you would understand; why she's asking for a house?

714
00:45:16,379 --> 00:45:18,272
She was living in the palace of Firaun(فرعون).

715
00:45:18,959 --> 00:45:19,969
She's the queen.

716
00:45:20,799 --> 00:45:23,938
She has everything, a woman seeking Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) would ask for.

717
00:45:24,758 --> 00:45:27,478
She has everything that Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) can offer.

718
00:45:28,225 --> 00:45:31,757
But the thing that was missing; there was Islam and Eeman(ايمان).

719
00:45:32,937 --> 00:45:38,433
She was living in that place like an alien or a stranger, who doesn't belong there.

720
00:45:39,599 --> 00:45:40,913
She's saying; Oh Allah!

721
00:45:41,266 --> 00:45:42,569
اِبْنِ لِى عِندَكَ بَيْتًا فِى ٱلْجَنَّة

722
00:45:42,589 --> 00:45:44,123
Oh Allah! Built for me a house in Jannah(جنة).

723
00:45:44,383 --> 00:45:49,058
I'm not gonna live in it now, But one day, In Sha Allahu Ta'ala(إنْ شاءالله تعالى), I'll be able to be there.

724
00:45:49,078 --> 00:45:51,625
So, prepare it for me, Build it for me.

725
00:45:51,705 --> 00:45:55,958
And then she said, when she said; Build for me a house in Jannah(جنة), she said;

726
00:45:56,138 --> 00:45:57,804
وَنَجِّنِى مِن فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِۦ

727
00:45:57,824 --> 00:46:00,091
And save me from Firaun(فرعون) and his deeds.

728
00:46:00,618 --> 00:46:04,755
So built for me a house in Jannah(جنة) and then take me out of this environment.

729
00:46:05,602 --> 00:46:07,229
وَنَجِّنِى مِن فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِۦ

730
00:46:07,269 --> 00:46:08,286
Take me out of this place.

731
00:46:08,793 --> 00:46:14,413
She has gold, she has silver, she has the servents, she's the queen over Egypt,

732
00:46:14,753 --> 00:46:16,872
but she's saying; Oh Allah! Take me out of that environment;

733
00:46:17,252 --> 00:46:18,592
take me out; I don't wanna be there.

734
00:46:19,552 --> 00:46:24,141
وَنَجِّنِى مِن فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِۦ وَنَجِّنِى مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ۝

735
00:46:24,165 --> 00:46:25,899
Take me away from these oppressive people.

736
00:46:26,505 --> 00:46:35,124
That is why, Asiyah(آسيه) qualified to be one of the four women, whom Rasool Allah ﷺ praise in Hadith(حديث).

737
00:46:35,377 --> 00:46:36,433
Rasool Allah ﷺ says;

738
00:46:36,453 --> 00:46:37,813
كَمَلَ مِنَ الرِّجَالِ كَثِيرٌ

739
00:46:38,267 --> 00:46:40,253
The men who were complete were many.

740
00:46:40,833 --> 00:46:42,679
ولم يَكْمُلْ من النساءِ إلااَربَعَة

741
00:46:42,699 --> 00:46:44,912
But the women, who are complete are only four.

742
00:46:45,812 --> 00:46:47,971
Rasool Allah ﷺ said; These four were;

743
00:46:48,111 --> 00:46:49,891
Maryam Bint-e-Imran(مريم بنت عمران)

744
00:46:50,365 --> 00:46:52,705
and Asiyah Imra'atu Firaun(آسيه اِمْرَأَتُ فِرْعَوْنَ)

745
00:46:53,371 --> 00:46:55,874
and Khadijah(خديجه) and Fatima(فاطمه).

746
00:46:56,234 --> 00:47:02,980
And we find that these four women are relating in some way or another to Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء).

747
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:05,773
Two of them raised up Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء)

748
00:47:06,180 --> 00:47:09,631
and one of them was the wife of a Nabi(نَبِي) and the other one was a daughter of a Nabi(نَبِي).

749
00:47:10,418 --> 00:47:12,903
Maryam(مريم) and Asiyah(آسيه) raised up Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء).

750
00:47:12,923 --> 00:47:16,441
Maryam(مريم) raised up Eesa(عيسى) and Asiyah(آسيه) raised up Musa(موسى)

751
00:47:16,728 --> 00:47:18,681
and Khadijah(خديجه) has a wife of a Nabi(نَبِي)

752
00:47:18,895 --> 00:47:23,772
and Fatima Bint-e-Muhammad(فاطمه بنت محمد) is the daughter of the leader of the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء); Muhammadﷺ.

753
00:47:24,412 --> 00:47:26,692
These are the only four complete women.

754
00:47:26,999 --> 00:47:34,618
Asiyah(آسيه) believed in the message of Syedina Musa(سيدنا موسى), so did Momin-Al-Firaun(مومن ال فرعون),

755
00:47:34,844 --> 00:47:37,818
 and then the rest, if we would take the Tafseer(تفسير) of;

756
00:47:37,892 --> 00:47:39,954
فَمَآ ءَامَنَ لِمُوسَىٰٓ إِلَّا ذُرِّيَّةٌ مِّن قَوْمِهِۦ

757
00:47:40,200 --> 00:47:43,247
That would mean some children from the people of Firaun(فرعون)

758
00:47:43,667 --> 00:47:48,919
and there's also Mashitut-Al-Firaun(ماشتت ال فرعون); there's one woman who used to comb for the daughters.

759
00:47:49,033 --> 00:47:51,466
But to sum it up; there are only a few who believe.

760
00:47:51,806 --> 00:47:55,453
This is the end of the story of Musa(موسى) and Firaun(فرعون).

761
00:47:56,015 --> 00:47:58,035
Now, we'll start with a new chapter

762
00:47:58,415 --> 00:48:00,878
and that is The story of Musa(موسى) and Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

763
00:48:01,768 --> 00:48:05,937
صَلَّى الله عَلى سَيَّدِنَا محمد وَعَلى اَلِهِ وَ صَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ تسلیما کثیرا

